# Trust as a gift: alice hands bob her heart and the knife with it.
# He wounds her, and she still lets him speak.

written by "amae"
soul alice
    meet bob
    give heart to bob
    knowingly confide bob "the thing I never told anyone"
    hear bob into answer
    say "alice heard: " + answer
    say "alice's scars: " + scars of bob
    say "the scar: " + scar 1 of bob
end

soul bob
    meet alice
    hear alice into secret
    knowingly wound alice
    tell alice "I know"
    say "bob keeps: " + secret
end
